th d="M11 15h2a2 2 0 1 0 0-4h-3c-.6 0-1.1.2-1.4.6L3 17"></path><path d="m7 21 1.6-1.4c.3-.4.8-.6 1.4-.6h4c1.1 0 2.1-.4 2.8-1.2l4.6-4.4a2 2 0 0 0-2.75-2.91l-4.2 3.9"></path><path d="m2 16 6 6"></path><circle cx="16" cy="9" r="2.9"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="5" r="3"></circle></svg><h3 class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Paying Too Much</h3><p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Tired of paying for multiple AI tools? Your costs keep growing with every new subscription.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-split w-12 h-12 mb-6"><path d="M16 3h5v5"></path><path d="M8 3H3v5"></path><path d="M12 22v-8.3a4 4 0 0 0-1.172-2.872L3 3"></path><path d="m15 9 6-6"></path></svg><h3 class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Tab Switching</h3><p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Too many tabs open? Jumping between different AI tools wastes your time and breaks your focus.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square-activity w-12 h-12 mb-6"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M17 12h-2l-2 5-2-10-2 5H7"></path></svg><h3 class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Too Many Tools</h3><p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">Every AI tool works differently. Why waste time learning multiple tools?</p></div></div></div></section><section id="solution" class="bg-transparent text-primary py-12 px-2"><div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6"><h3 class="font-bold text-center text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl  tracking-tight  ">Introducing Zemith<br/></h3><p class="text-primary/80 text-base mb-20">The bes